---
import '@fontsource/dm-sans/latin-400.css';
import '@fontsource/dm-sans/latin-500.css';
import '@fontsource/dm-sans/latin-600.css';
import '@fontsource/instrument-serif/latin-400.css';
import '@fontsource/instrument-serif/latin-400-italic.css';
import '../styles/concepts.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#101312" />
    <title>fynxlab — 视觉方向预览</title>
    <meta name="description" content="fynxlab 网站的四种备选视觉风格预览。" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip" href="#concepts">跳转到方案</a>
    <header class="preview-header">
      <div class="preview-container preview-header-inner">
        <a class="preview-logo" href="/" aria-label="返回 fynxlab 英文首页">fynxlab<span>.</span></a>
        <span class="preview-status"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> DESIGN STUDY / 2026</span>
        <a class="back-link" href="/">返回当前首页 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main id="concepts">
      <div class="preview-container page-heading">
        <div class="heading-top"><span>CREATIVE DIRECTION / 01—04</span><span>SCROLL TO EXPLORE ↓</span></div>
        <h1>同一个工作室，<br /><em>四种表达方式。</em></h1>
        <p>下面是四组可以直接感受版式、配色和产品展示方式的概念预览。每组展示首页首屏与产品入口；当前正式首页不会受到影响。</p>
        <nav class="index-nav" aria-label="跳转至视觉方案">
          <a href="#direction-a"><span>A</span> 瑞士现代主义 ↗</a>
          <a href="#direction-b"><span>B</span> 工业设计档案 ↗</a>
          <a href="#direction-c"><span>C</span> 电影式产品展示 ↗</a>
          <a href="#direction-d"><span>D</span> 高端商务品牌 ↗</a>
        </nav>
      </div>

      <section class="direction" id="direction-a" aria-labelledby="title-a">
        <div class="preview-container direction-caption"><div><span class="direction-number">01 / 04</span><h2 id="title-a">A. 瑞士现代主义</h2></div><p>硬朗网格 · 高对比 · 极少修饰<br />像一份清晰、有主见的设计声明。</p></div>
        <div class="preview-container">
          <div class="concept swiss">
            <div class="swiss-head"><strong>FYNX<span>LAB</span><i>•</i></strong><span>INDEPENDENT SOFTWARE STUDIO</span><span>EN / 中文</span></div>
            <div class="swiss-body">
              <div class="swiss-main"><span class="swiss-overline">DEVELOPMENT STUDIO · FYNXLAB</span><h3>BUILD<br />BETTER<br /><span>SOFTWARE<span class="swiss-period">.</span></span></h3><p>Useful products. Thoughtful development.<br />No excess, just what matters.</p><a href="mailto:admin@fynxlab.com">TALK ABOUT A PROJECT <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
              <div class="swiss-side"><span class="swiss-big-number">01<span> / 02</span></span><span class="swiss-side-note">DESIGNED FOR<br />THE WAY YOU WORK.</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="swiss-bottom"><span>SELECTED WORK ↓</span><a href="https://kyna.fynxlab.com/">Kyna Player ↗</a><a href="https://pinlaunch.fynxlab.com/">PinLaunch ↗</a><span>© FYNXLAB</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="preview-container direction-tags"><span>感觉：理性 / 果断</span><span>适合：强调团队的专业执行力</span></div>
      </section>

      <section class="direction" id="direction-b" aria-labelledby="title-b">
        <div class="preview-container direction-caption"><div><span class="direction-number">02 / 04</span><h2 id="title-b">B. 工业设计档案</h2></div><p>工程制图 · 精确标注 · 深海蓝灰<br /><a href="/">已选定，查看结合 Logo 配色后的正式首页 ↗</a></p></div>
        <div class="preview-container">
          <div class="concept blueprint">
            <div class="blue-top"><span>F / L <span class="blue-muted">—</span> FYNXLAB</span><span>PRODUCTS&nbsp; / &nbsp;DEVELOPMENT&nbsp; / &nbsp;CONTACT</span><span>SPEC. 001 <span class="blue-dot">●</span></span></div>
            <div class="blue-layout">
              <div class="blue-copy"><span class="blue-marker">[ STUDIO STATEMENT / 001 ]</span><h3>ENGINEERED<br /><span>WITH INTENT.</span></h3><p>Software should feel effortless. The thinking behind it never is.</p><a href="mailto:admin@fynxlab.com">START A PROJECT <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="blue-coordinates">SYSTEM / INTENT / DETAIL</div></div>
              <div class="blue-specimen"><div class="blue-frame-top"><span>FIG. 01 — PRODUCT STUDY</span><span>+</span></div><div class="blue-image"><img src="/images/kyna-player.webp" alt="Kyna Player 播放器界面" width="976" height="556" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div><div class="blue-image-caption"><a href="https://kyna.fynxlab.com/">KYNA PLAYER ↗</a><span>NATIVE / WINDOWS</span></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="blue-bottom"><span>01 — KYNA PLAYER</span><span>02 — PINLAUNCH</span><a href="https://pinlaunch.fynxlab.com/">VIEW NEXT PRODUCT ↗</a></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="preview-container direction-tags"><span>感觉：严谨 / 可信</span><span>适合：同时呈现产品与开发能力</span></div>
      </section>

      <section class="direction" id="direction-c" aria-labelledby="title-c">
        <div class="preview-container direction-caption"><div><span class="direction-number">03 / 04</span><h2 id="title-c">C. 电影式产品展示</h2></div><p>沉浸画面 · 戏剧化明暗 · 少量文字<br />先让作品说话，再介绍创造作品的人。</p></div>
        <div class="preview-container">
          <div class="concept cinematic">
            <div class="cinema-background" role="img" aria-label="Kyna Player 播放海边日落画面"></div>
            <div class="cinema-top"><span class="cinema-brand">fynxlab<span>®</span></span><span>PRODUCTS &nbsp; — &nbsp; STUDIO &nbsp; — &nbsp; CONTACT</span><span>EN / 中文</span></div>
            <div class="cinema-copy"><span class="cinema-kicker"><span aria-hidden="true">●</span> SOFTWARE THAT STAYS WITH YOU</span><h3>Made to be<br /><em>felt.</em></h3><p>Tools for the moments that matter.<br />Built with care, from first thought to final detail.</p><a href="https://kyna.fynxlab.com/">DISCOVER KYNA PLAYER <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
            <div class="cinema-bottom"><span>01 / 02 &nbsp; FEATURED PRODUCT</span><div><span class="cinema-line"></span><span class="cinema-line dim"></span></div><a href="https://pinlaunch.fynxlab.com/">NEXT: PINLAUNCH &nbsp; →</a></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="preview-container direction-tags"><span>感觉：沉浸 / 有感染力</span><span>适合：把产品体验放在第一位</span></div>
      </section>

      <section class="direction" id="direction-d" aria-labelledby="title-d">
        <div class="preview-container direction-caption"><div><span class="direction-number">04 / 04</span><h2 id="title-d">D. 高端商务品牌</h2></div><p>深海军蓝 · 香槟金 · 古典比例<br />更侧重稳健、可信赖的合作形象。</p></div>
        <div class="preview-container">
          <div class="concept premium">
            <div class="premium-inner"><div class="premium-top"><span class="premium-brand">FYNXLAB<span>✳</span></span><span>WORK &nbsp;&nbsp; THE STUDIO &nbsp;&nbsp; CONTACT</span><span>EN &nbsp;/&nbsp; 中文</span></div>
              <div class="premium-center"><div class="premium-ornament" aria-hidden="true">F</div><span>SOFTWARE DEVELOPMENT STUDIO</span><h3>Built with purpose.<br /><em>Made to endure.</em></h3><p>We create considered software and bring the same care<br />to the projects we build with our clients.</p><a href="mailto:admin@fynxlab.com">DISCUSS A PROJECT <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
              <div class="premium-bottom"><span>OUR WORK</span><a href="https://kyna.fynxlab.com/">01 &nbsp; KYNA PLAYER <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="https://pinlaunch.fynxlab.com/">02 &nbsp; PINLAUNCH <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><span>© FYNXLAB</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="preview-container direction-tags"><span>感觉：克制 / 稳重</span><span>适合：突出开发服务的信任感</span></div>
      </section>

      <footer class="preview-container preview-footer"><div><span>FOUR DIRECTIONS. ONE DECISION.</span><h2>你更喜欢哪一个？</h2><p>告诉我 A、B、C、D，或说说想组合哪些元素。选定后再替换正式首页。</p></div><a href="#concepts">返回顶部 ↑</a></footer>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
